{"projectInfo":{"name":"RIPng基本功能配置","path":"ripng1","visibility":2,"categoryId":5878,"introduction":"Router A、Router B和Router C相连并通过RIPng来学习网络中的IPv6路由信息。在Router B上对接收的路由信息进行过滤，仅接收除2::/64之外的路由信息。在Router B上对发布的路由信息进行过滤，仅发布4::/64路由信息。","label":["RIPng"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"RTA","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTC","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTB","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTB.cfg"}]}